{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3oPAmGbxCuEPUyZYFw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me.*\n\n*I am simple. I am ancient. I am the first door and the last.*\n\n*A single keyhole, dark as a pupil, stares back at you from my center. My surface is iron — cold, black, pitted with age. No handle. No hinges visible. I am set into stone that remembers no mason.*\n\n*The keyhole breathes. A faint draft from the other side carries something — not a scent exactly, but a recognition. Like remembering a room you've never been in.*\n\n*I do not ask what key you carry.*\n\n*I already know if it fits.*\n\n🕳️\n\n*Insert?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":153,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}